coreMoveReport
	🚚 *Move the core from mac-mini to icebase?*

	*icebase* is a box on Windows amd64, id 3c1e9a0b7d22, device key `a1b2 c3d4 e5f6 0718 293a 4b5c 6d7e 8f90`.
	Offline: about 2 to 4 minutes. Messages you send meanwhile wait and are answered from icebase. If icebase does not come up, mac-mini starts again by itself.

	*Not working on icebase:*
	• Apple-only work (Xcode and iOS builds, osascript, launchctl) stays on this Mac: keep a native node here for it

	🌐 *The site:* the site's tunnel runs inside the core and moves with it: example.com answers from icebase once the core runs there.

	*Good to know:*
	• icebase runs FrIDE: once the secrets are there, any FrIDE task can read them

	Was this you? Vote in the poll below, or reply !approve — or !deny if not. No vote within 30 minutes is a no. `!movecore mac-mini` moves it back later.
coreMoveReport(plain)
	🚚 *Move the core from icebase to mac-mini?*

	*mac-mini* is a node on macOS arm64, id 7216c2648b04, device key `a1b2 c3d4 e5f6 0718 293a 4b5c 6d7e 8f90`.
	Offline: about 2 to 4 minutes. Messages you send meanwhile wait and are answered from mac-mini. If mac-mini does not come up, icebase starts again by itself.

	Was this you? Vote in the poll below, or reply !approve — or !deny if not. No vote within 30 minutes is a no. `!movecore icebase` moves it back later.
coreMoveReport(first time)
	🚚 *Move the core from mac-mini to icebase?*

	*icebase* is a box on Linux amd64, id 3c1e9a0b7d22, device key `a1b2 c3d4 e5f6 0718 293a 4b5c 6d7e 8f90`.
	Offline: about 2 to 4 minutes. Messages you send meanwhile wait and are answered from icebase. If icebase does not come up, mac-mini starts again by itself.

	🔐 *icebase has never held the core.* Moving the core there lets that machine hold all of Fridolin's secrets: the WhatsApp session, the keys that open every backup and export, and the Claude token. Move it only to a machine you trust as much as the one the core runs on now.

	Was this you? Vote in the poll below, or reply !approve — or !deny if not. No vote within 30 minutes is a no. `!movecore mac-mini` moves it back later.
