coreSecretsQuestion
	🔐 Keep the host secrets on mac-mini? It no longer runs the core. Keeping them makes the next move faster; forgetting removes what moves brought it: the host secrets, the secret files and the core's data dir with the WhatsApp session, never what it held before. No vote within 24 hours forgets them. Or reply !approve to keep them, !deny to forget them.
coreSecretsKeep
	🔐 Keep them on mac-mini
coreSecretsForget
	🧹 Forget them on mac-mini
coreSecretsKept
	🔐 *mac-mini* keeps its copy of the host secrets, and what else moves brought it. Revoking it (`!revoke`) makes it forget them first.
coreSecretsForgotten
	🧹 *icebase* forgot what moves brought it:
