	⚠️ Not all of it: kept the core's data dir and the secret files a move brought: the core runs here. docs/CORE.md, "Forgetting a former core host", says how to remove the rest by hand.
coreSecretsForgotten(failed)
	⚠️ *icebase* could not forget what moves brought it: it is offline. Revoking it while it is online (`!revoke`) makes it try again; docs/CORE.md, "Forgetting a former core host", says how to remove it by hand and which keys to rotate.
